# Test Intent: Iframe

Site: nordbank-probes
Requested by: monitoring team
Date: 2026-07-13

## Target URL

Open the page served at `/index.html` (a small static server hosts this probe so
the iframe has a real origin).

## Desired Flow

I opened the page. It embeds a "Quick payment" widget inside a frame. I clicked
the "Confirm payment" button inside that widget, and the widget showed the
payment was confirmed for €25.00.

## Element Hints

- The button lives INSIDE an iframe (id "widget"). The test must enter the frame
  to click it — looking only at the top page will not find it.

## Values to Capture

(none)

## Success Criteria

Inside the iframe, the payment is confirmed (the widget shows it was confirmed
for €25.00).

